WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.200
<v Narrator><i>The ship reaches the misty land of the Cimmerians at Ocean's edge.</i>

2
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:23.570
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus digs a trench, pours libations, sacrifices sheep, and holds the spirits back with his sword.</i>

3
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:32.260
<v Narrator><i>The dead gather in multitudes, crying around the blood.</i>

4
00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:41.350
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus waits for Tiresias before allowing any other shade to drink.</i>
